{"id":55165,"date":"2026-07-28T08:41:40","date_gmt":"2026-07-28T07:41:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=55165"},"modified":"2026-09-03T00:27:22","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T23:27:22","slug":"trail-dolorosa-de-moldes","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-dolorosa-de-moldes\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Dolorosa de Moldes 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Dolorosa de Moldes 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Dolorosa de Moldes 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>3 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, na pitoresca aldeia de <strong>Moldes<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Arouca<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>Confraria Trotamontes<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Arouca<\/strong> e a <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Moldes<\/strong>, a prova constitui a 2\u00aa etapa do aclamado <strong>5\u00ba Circuito Terras do Mundo \/ Serra da Freita<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada no Centro Cultural e Recreativo de Moldes, o evento conta com a exigente prova de <strong>Trail Curto de 16 km com 1000 metros de desn\u00edvel positivo acumulado (D+)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong>, e com a <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h45<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado percorre os cumes agrestes do Detrelo da Malhada e os encantos do Arouca Geopark, oferecendo medalha finisher, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e banhos nas Piscinas Municipais de Arouca.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; widt