 12px;\">Os participantes t\u00eam \u00e0 disposi\u00e7\u00e3o os balne\u00e1rios com duches quentes nas <strong>Piscinas Municipais de Arouca<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma <a href=\"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trail-dolorosa-de-moldes-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stop&#038;Go<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Dolorosa de Moldes 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-03\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Centro Cultural e Recreativo de Moldes, Arouca\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Arouca\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Confraria Trotamontes, Munic\u00edpio de Arouca e JF de Moldes\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Dolorosa de Moldes 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 3 de Outubro de 2026 , com partida no Centro Cultural e Recreativo de Moldes 